{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは~"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46 （新）4期生 岩手県出身"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"佐藤璃果です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHZ3ZS1QX5JZZ83GGRRTD4J1","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"のぎおびの時に明日新しいお洋服が届くのにー！とお話していたその服です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この間、ゆなちゃんもその服可愛い~！と見た瞬間に言ってくれたんです！♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"（嬉しくて顔をあまり見れなかったのでゆなちゃんじゃなかったらごめんなさい。）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メイクさんにも可愛いと言って貰えて嬉しかった~︎︎︎︎︎☺︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHZ3ZT8DNY7T240H0ZWWCAYV","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個人的にはお洋服がシンデレラっぽくて凄く好き。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回のEX大衆さんのオフショット続き~"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHZ3ZV9WH06CV9CPWK59253G","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHZ3ZWCXX494Q2H8WXN3RFPA","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雑誌に関しての皆さんからの温かいコメント嬉しいです！ありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前髪分けも好評で嬉しい( *˙˙*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"~EX大衆10月号さん発売中です~"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"21日月曜25:29~日本テレビ系列さんにて\n｢ノギザカスキッツ｣\nが放送です！\n｢キュンキュン病棟24時｣に出演させて頂きました。\n全力キュンキュン受け取ってください~"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回、15日の時に書けばよかったのですが、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"9月13日、大園桃子さん、\n❁お誕生日おめでとうございます❁"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大園さんの心の底が優しいところ本当に素敵だなと思います。私も大園さんのお言葉に助けられたことがあります！真っ直ぐな大園さんものすごく憧れます！訛りも心地よくて好きです。安心します。またお話出来ればと思います( *´﹀`* )\n素敵な一年になりますように。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日はーるなぴです！！のぎおび楽しかったですね！\nまさか1本だと思わなくて私もビックリしました（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お疲れ様~。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"9月20日の誕生花｢ヤブラン｣の花言葉のように"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"心の中に隠された熱い想いを持ちつつ、忍耐力を大事に、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日々生きていきたいです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近また一段と涼しくなってきました。秋の訪れですね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気温の変化や天気の変化が激しい\n日々ですが、体調にお気をつけください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは皆さんにとって素敵な一日になりますように。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも素敵なコメントありがとうございます！短くても長くても本当にどちらでも嬉しい！全部読んでいます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"世間では4連休ですが、皆さんは何をするのかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHZ3ZXCWXZQZ0FSWDZTYJESP","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またね~( ˊ꒳ˋ ) ᐝ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"#30 りか"}],"source":"archive"}